(DIRGHA FARMS) Tj
T*
(Managed Farmland Due Diligence Checklist) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Use this checklist before committing capital to any farmland project.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1\) Land title and legal) Tj
T*
(- Verify title chain, encumbrances, and litigation status.) Tj
T*
(- Confirm agricultural classification and sale deed structure.) Tj
T*
(- Ask for independent legal due diligence reports.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2\) Operator track record) Tj
T*
(- How long has the operator managed this exact land?) Tj
T*
(- Review harvest records and sale receipts from prior seasons.) Tj
T*
(- Validate on-ground team continuity and succession risk.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3\) Water and soil) Tj
T*
(- Check source, depth, and trend of water table.) Tj
T*
(- Review recent soil testing and crop suitability evidence.) Tj
T*
(- Inspect irrigation and rainwater infrastructure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4\) Organic and produce verification) Tj
T*
(- Validate certification body and renewal history.) Tj
T*
(- Ask for independent lab testing with dates.) Tj
T*
(- Confirm actual current crops, not only future claims.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5\) Maintenance economics) Tj
T*
(- Understand annual fees and line-item coverage.) Tj
T*
(- If no fee, verify how operations are funded.) Tj
T*
(- Check hidden charges for utilities and upkeep.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6\) Community and governance) Tj
T*
(- Evaluate owner cap, governance structure, and dispute process.) Tj
T*
(- Clarify developer-retained land and operating rights.) Tj
T*
(- Speak to existing owners where possible.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7\) Exit and liquidity) Tj
T*
(- Review lock-ins, transfer restrictions, and resale support.) Tj
T*
(- Assess realistic secondary demand in that micro-market.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8\) Red flags) Tj
T*
(- Guaranteed ROI statements or pressure-driven urgency.) Tj
T*
(- Refusal to share records, testing reports, or legal documents.) Tj
T*
(- No on-ground operational presence.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If a project passes most checks with evidence, schedule a site visit.) Tj
T*
(If it fails most checks, pause and reassess.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Dirgha Farms | Designed for longevity and clarity) Tj
